<title>USA: Norfolk Southern gets financing for bid.</title>
<headline>Norfolk Southern gets financing for bid.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp said it has received bank commitments to finance its revised $10 billion bid for Conrail Inc.</p>
<p>Norfolk Southern has launched a rival bid to Conrail's planned $8.5 billion merger with CSX Corp.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212/859-1710</p>
</text>
